A||||6||fierofrek||Front fascia from GT's?||||5||
Z||000000||fierofrek||06-19-2001||08:29 PM||||is there any difference between the front Fascias on the 84 through 88 GT's? just wondering, cause I was thinking of trying to change the front to GT as I have the back as GT now. THX for any help.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||5
Z||000001||Old Lar||06-19-2001||08:46 PM||||There was no 84 GT.  The facia on the pace car was the fascia for the later GT models.<BR>I believe that any fascia will fit on any Fiero.  The differences would be the moldings use on the car.  Grooved on the coupes or rounded as on the GT models.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Ed||06-19-2001||09:48 PM||||My car is in the body shop now.  I got an '85 rounded fascia to replace my '87's. See "THUMPED"  from a while back. <P>Old Lar is correct.  It appears a very minor amount of cutting is necessary to remove the grooved '85 molding and replace it with the rounded mouldings and side markers of the '87.  <P>I don't anticipate a problem, but fierofrek, you should make sure the moldings are consistently either round or grooved all along the body of the car.  ||||reg||1
Z||000003||hyhy4u||06-19-2001||10:41 PM||||The 84 Indy and 85-88 GT front Facias  are all the same.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Devotshka||06-19-2001||10:44 PM||||If memory serves, when you go from a coupe nose to an aero nose you will also need to replace the inner fender well skirt, as the coupe ones will not fit properly (on forward end) on the aero front fascias.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Ed||06-20-2001||12:26 AM||||I repeat:  The aero (GT) fronts are very close, but not identical.  Come over to my body shop and I'll show you. That's not to say you can't adapt one for the other with some very minor work.  <P>The side markers and rub strips are slightly different.  Grooved versus round, agreeing with Old Lar.||||reg||1
Z||000006||fierofrek||06-20-2001||02:00 AM||||Cool, thx guys for the replies! ok, one more quick question, will I be having to fabricate any additional support brackets anywhere?||||reg||12
